ould theoretically be harvested for Pyros, but there exists a possibility of Flux contamination. Also, without a Promethean to feed from they're a non-renewable resource. Sublimati, on the other hand, can replenish their Pyros by eating human flesh. An enterprising Alchemist could keep one captive and feed it medical waste. There's no way <i>that</i> could go wrong.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-09T17:37:56-07:00","id":1148478,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">I\u2019m glad I asked, thinking there had to be something obvious that I was missing. This does not seem to be the case for the core promethean rules. I was hoping that there would be some option that would work for an alchemist. to make them viable. Without minimally adequate source of pryos Alchemist can\u2019t do alchemy. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">I have an existing character that already has some supernatural merits befitting an alchemist, do you have any recommendations for other approaches in keeping with alchemist character concept.</span></span></b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18291-unrepentantweed","name":"Unrepentantweed","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-10T05:57:38-07:00","id":1148560,"title":"","content":"The alchemists presented in the core book aren't designed with player characters in mind, and it's assumed that they'll supplement their meager reserves with Pyros stolen from Prometheans. If you want something a bit more playable, I've worked up some <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/989195-alternate-alchemist-rules\">alternate alchemist rules</a> that <i>are</i> designed with player characters in mind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-10T14:14:37-07:00","id":1148677,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Teatime</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1148327-additional-sources-of-pyros-for-alchemists?p=1148419#post1148419\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pandorans could theoretically be harvested for Pyros, but there exists a possibility of Flux contamination. Also, without a Promethean to feed from they're a non-renewable resource. Sublimati, on the other hand, can replenish their Pyros by eating human flesh. An enterprising Alchemist could keep one captive and feed it medical waste. There's no way <i>that</i> could go wrong.</div> </div> </div> </div>Other then it escaping and killing the alchemist.<br /> <br /> Or it could when a Promethean comes &quot;Within range&quot; of it, escape, possibly with the help of new offspring, then possibly find more Pandorans, And work up a trap for the alchemist... or think it would focus on corrupting the promethean(s)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-11T02:30:42-07:00","id":1148781,"title":"","content":"Or finding a way to freely leave and reenter the containment to snack on live patients.<br /> <br /> Or somehow releasing Flux-charged contaminants into its surroundings.<br /> <br /> Or using persuasion, blackmail or mind-influence to get the Alchemist to feed it better.<br /> <br /> So many options...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-12T12:58:50-07:00","id":1149212,"title":"","content":"Trade some porno for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}